      "writtenOn": "2022-04-18T23:25:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some of the items in here aren\u0027t very related to PD as far as our codebase is concerned. I think it would be nice going forward if the DPM acted as an interface between the PD stack and the rest of the system. (This would fit well with what Sam is currently doing upstream in Zephyr.) So maybe we could have a function like `dpm_get_status_msg` or `dpm_populate_status_msg` that handled all the GPIO polling and sensor checking and whatever else we need to do to get this info.",
